WEBVTT

00:01.382 --> 00:02.550
KATARA: Water...

00:03.760 --> 00:04.928
Earth...

00:05.678 --> 00:07.013
Fire...

00:07.805 --> 00:09.182
Air.

00:10.099 --> 00:14.103
Long ago, the four nations
lived together in harmony.

00:14.354 --> 00:17.690
Then everything changed
when the Fire Nation attacked.

00:18.608 --> 00:21.486
Only the Avatar,
master of all four elements,

00:21.569 --> 00:22.570
could stop them.

00:22.654 --> 00:24.614
But when the world
needed him most,

00:24.697 --> 00:25.698
he vanished.

00:26.074 --> 00:27.367
100 years passed,

00:27.450 --> 00:29.994
and my brother and I
discovered the new Avatar―

00:30.078 --> 00:31.704
An airbender named Aang.

00:31.788 --> 00:33.915
And although his airbending
skills are great,

00:33.998 --> 00:36.668
He has a lot to learn before
he's ready to save anyone.

00:36.751 --> 00:37.752
AANG: Oof!

00:37.835 --> 00:40.797
But I believe Aang can save the world.

00:49.305 --> 00:50.515
We need to find King Bumi

00:50.598 --> 00:52.767
so Aang can learn
earthbending somewhere safe.

00:52.850 --> 00:54.769
MAN: Sounds like you're
headed to Omashu.

00:55.186 --> 00:59.983
I present to you the Earth Kingdom city
of Om― Oh, no.

01:00.400 --> 01:03.278
I guess I need to find someone else
to teach me earthbending.

01:03.361 --> 01:07.907
You need to find someone
who waits and listens before striking.

01:08.366 --> 01:11.911
In the swamp, we see
visions of people we've lost,

01:11.995 --> 01:13.079
people we loved.

01:13.413 --> 01:14.998
But what about my vision?

01:15.081 --> 01:16.583
It was someone I had never met.

01:26.551 --> 01:30.388
It's pricey, but I really do like it.

01:30.471 --> 01:33.600
Then you should get it.
You deserve something nice.

01:33.683 --> 01:34.976
I do, don't I?

01:35.351 --> 01:38.313
But no. It's too expensive. I shouldn't.

01:38.396 --> 01:39.731
All right. Then don't.

01:44.068 --> 01:45.987
You know what? I'm gonna get it.

01:47.113 --> 01:48.323
Psst, psst.

01:48.406 --> 01:50.158
Hey, you kids like earthbending?

01:50.241 --> 01:51.951
You like throwing rocks?

01:52.327 --> 01:55.496
Then check out
Master Yu's earthbending academy.

01:58.249 --> 02:00.209
AANG: Look. There's a coupon on the back.

02:00.376 --> 02:01.628
The first lesson is free.

02:02.003 --> 02:04.130
Who knows? This Master Yu could be

02:04.213 --> 02:06.507
the earthbending teacher
you've been looking for.

02:13.097 --> 02:14.599
( SNIFFS )

02:17.143 --> 02:18.770
Take your stances.

02:19.979 --> 02:23.441
Now strike as if you're punching
through your opponent's head.

02:25.026 --> 02:26.152
Hyah!

02:28.446 --> 02:31.240
So are you ready to commit
to more lessons?

02:31.324 --> 02:33.493
If you pay for the whole year
in advance,

02:33.576 --> 02:36.037
I'll bump you up
to the next belt.

02:39.582 --> 02:41.376
Eh, he's not the one.

02:42.293 --> 02:44.504
I think the Boulder
is gonna win back the belt

02:44.587 --> 02:45.713
at Earth Rumble 6.

02:45.797 --> 02:47.674
He's gonna have
to fight his way through

02:47.757 --> 02:50.927
the best earthbenders in the world
to even get a shot at the champ.

02:51.010 --> 02:54.013
Excuse me. But where is this
earthbending tournament exactly?

02:54.097 --> 02:55.598
It's on the island of Noneoya―

02:55.765 --> 02:57.141
None o' ya business.

02:57.225 --> 02:58.726
- Ha ha!
- Ha ha!

02:59.352 --> 03:01.604
Ha ha!

03:01.896 --> 03:04.440
Oh, I got to remember that one.

03:04.524 --> 03:05.775
I'll take care of this.

03:06.734 --> 03:08.736
Hey, strong guys, wait up.

03:10.988 --> 03:13.908
What was I thinking?
I don't need a new bag.

03:13.991 --> 03:16.035
Why'd you let me buy this?

03:17.286 --> 03:18.913
( PURRING )

03:19.497 --> 03:21.499
You ready to find an earthbending teacher,

03:21.582 --> 03:24.335
because we're going to Earth Rumble 6.

03:24.419 --> 03:26.129
How did you get them to tell you?

03:26.212 --> 03:28.047
Oh, a girl has her ways.

03:34.011 --> 03:35.555
( CROWD CHEERING )

03:36.806 --> 03:40.184
Hey, front row seats.
I wonder why no one else is sitting here.

03:41.060 --> 03:42.186
I guess that's why.

03:44.731 --> 03:45.940
( CHEERING GROWS LOUDER )

03:50.611 --> 03:53.114
Welcome to Earth Rumble 6.

03:53.573 --> 03:56.492
I am your host, Xin Fu.

03:56.951 --> 03:59.620
( SIGHS ) This is just
gonna be a bunch of guys

03:59.704 --> 04:01.581
chucking rocks at each other, isn't it?

04:01.664 --> 04:02.999
That's what I paid for.

04:03.416 --> 04:05.251
The rules are simple.

04:05.334 --> 04:07.295
Just knock the other guy out of the ring,

04:07.378 --> 04:08.880
and you win.

04:11.549 --> 04:12.717
( BELL RINGS )

04:12.800 --> 04:18.306
Round one― The Boulder
versus the Big Bad Hippo!

04:19.182 --> 04:20.641
( YELLS )

04:20.725 --> 04:25.021
Listen up, Hippo.
You may be big, but you ain't bad.

04:25.104 --> 04:29.025
The Boulder's gonna
win this in a landslide.

04:29.609 --> 04:32.069
Hippo mad!

04:35.698 --> 04:37.158
Hyah!

04:44.457 --> 04:46.793
XIN FU: Unbelievable,
ladies and gentlemen.

04:46.876 --> 04:48.628
The Hippo is rocking the Boulder.

05:03.059 --> 05:04.268
The Boulder wins.

05:04.352 --> 05:06.062
( CROWD CHEERS )

05:06.646 --> 05:07.897
How about the Boulder?

05:07.980 --> 05:09.273
He's got some good moves.

05:09.357 --> 05:12.944
I don't know. Bumi said I need a teacher
who listens to the earth.

05:13.277 --> 05:15.154
He's just listening
to his big muscles.

05:15.238 --> 05:16.531
What do you think, Sokka?

05:16.614 --> 05:18.658
Ha ha! Whoo!

05:18.825 --> 05:25.164
Next match, the Boulder
versus Fire Nation Man.

05:25.248 --> 05:27.458
( CROWD BOOS )

05:28.501 --> 05:30.586
Boo! Boo!

05:31.003 --> 05:32.463
Please do rise

05:32.547 --> 05:35.758
for Fire Nation national anthem.

05:35.842 --> 05:40.805
♪ Fire lord, my flame
burns for thee ♪

05:40.888 --> 05:42.306
( CROWD BOOING )

05:42.390 --> 05:45.059
Go back to the Fire Nation.

05:50.439 --> 05:52.358
No. No, please!

05:55.820 --> 05:57.572
Aah!

05:59.782 --> 06:01.409
Yeah! Whoo!

06:01.492 --> 06:04.370
The Boulder knows how
to put the hurt in the dirt.

06:04.453 --> 06:06.247
Yeah! Whoo!

06:06.747 --> 06:07.790
( ORGAN PLAYING )

06:10.293 --> 06:11.377
( BELL RINGS )

06:25.308 --> 06:29.228
XIN FU: Now the moment
you've all been waiting for―

06:29.312 --> 06:35.192
The Boulder versus your champion―
The Blind Bandit.

06:35.276 --> 06:36.736
( CROWD CHEERS )

06:36.819 --> 06:40.156
( CROWD CHANTING "BANDIT" )

06:40.239 --> 06:42.116
She can't really be blind.

06:42.199 --> 06:44.285
It's just part of her character, right?

06:44.368 --> 06:45.578
I think she is.

06:45.661 --> 06:46.704
I think she is...

06:46.787 --> 06:47.914
Going down!

06:50.082 --> 06:52.209
The Boulder feels conflicted

06:52.293 --> 06:55.087
about fighting a young blind girl.

06:55.171 --> 06:58.758
Sounds to me like you're scared, Boulder.

06:59.800 --> 07:02.511
The Boulder's over
his conflicted feelings,

07:02.595 --> 07:06.098
and now he's ready
to bury you in a rock-alanche.

07:06.557 --> 07:09.185
Whenever you're ready, the Pebble.

07:09.727 --> 07:11.187
Ha ha ha!

07:12.146 --> 07:13.439
( GIGGLES )

07:14.815 --> 07:15.858
Ha ha ha!

07:18.069 --> 07:19.236
It's on.

07:24.825 --> 07:26.285
( GROWLING )

07:26.369 --> 07:27.870
( GROWLING IN SLOW MOTION )

07:45.638 --> 07:46.639
Whoa!

07:47.098 --> 07:48.099
Ooh.

07:48.182 --> 07:50.184
Ooh!

07:56.440 --> 08:01.112
XIN FU: Your winner,
and still the champion, the Blind Bandit.

08:01.195 --> 08:04.824
( CRYING ) No!

08:05.408 --> 08:06.701
How did she do that?

08:07.243 --> 08:09.495
She waited and listened.

08:12.331 --> 08:14.709
To make things a little more interesting,

08:14.792 --> 08:17.545
I'm offering up this sack of gold pieces

08:17.628 --> 08:22.216
to anyone who can defeat
the Blind Bandit.

08:22.299 --> 08:25.928
What? No one dares to face her?

08:26.012 --> 08:27.346
I will.

08:31.934 --> 08:34.562
Go, Aang! Avenge the Boulder!

08:34.812 --> 08:37.523
Do people really want to see
two little girls

08:37.606 --> 08:38.774
fighting out here?

08:38.858 --> 08:40.943
CROWD: Ooh.

08:41.027 --> 08:42.611
I don't really want to fight you.

08:42.695 --> 08:44.155
I want to talk to you.

08:44.238 --> 08:46.323
Boo! No talking!

08:46.407 --> 08:47.742
Don't boo at him.

08:56.375 --> 08:58.669
Somebody's a little light on his feet.

08:58.753 --> 09:01.464
What's your fighting name,
the Fancy Dancer?

09:04.592 --> 09:06.052
Where'd you go?

09:06.844 --> 09:08.179
Please, wait.

09:08.262 --> 09:09.597
There you are.

09:11.682 --> 09:12.850
Aah!

09:20.024 --> 09:21.734
( CROWD CHEERS )

09:21.817 --> 09:23.069
Please listen!

09:23.152 --> 09:24.653
I need an earthbending teacher,

09:24.737 --> 09:26.489
and I think it's supposed to be you.

09:26.572 --> 09:28.657
Whoever you are, just leave me alone.

09:31.327 --> 09:32.495
Wait!

09:38.209 --> 09:39.627
( FANFARE )

09:40.461 --> 09:41.712
SOKKA: Way to go, champ.

09:49.178 --> 09:50.387
I got to admit,

09:50.471 --> 09:52.640
now I'm really glad I bought this bag.

09:52.723 --> 09:55.101
It matches the belt perfectly.

09:55.309 --> 09:57.061
That is a big relief.

09:57.144 --> 09:58.896
If we want to find the Blind Bandit,

09:58.979 --> 10:01.315
The earthbending academy
is a good place to start.

10:05.319 --> 10:07.655
Oh, great. You again.

10:08.739 --> 10:09.740
- Aah!
- Aah!

10:09.824 --> 10:11.075
Yeah. I didn't think so.

10:11.283 --> 10:12.493
Nicely done.

10:12.910 --> 10:15.538
Hey, you're the kid
who beat the Blind Bandit.

10:15.621 --> 10:17.081
AANG: We need to talk to her.

10:17.164 --> 10:18.749
Do you guys know where she lives?

10:18.958 --> 10:20.584
The Blind Bandit's a mystery.

10:20.668 --> 10:23.254
She shows up to fight,
then disappears.

10:24.338 --> 10:26.340
Let me handle this.

10:26.423 --> 10:28.134
You're not telling us everything.

10:28.509 --> 10:30.094
No, no. I swear it's true.

10:30.177 --> 10:32.930
No one knows where she goes
or who she really is.

10:33.055 --> 10:35.766
That's because we're asking
about the wrong person.

10:35.891 --> 10:38.811
In my vision, I saw a girl
in a white dress

10:38.894 --> 10:40.312
with a pet flying boar.

10:40.396 --> 10:41.605
Know anybody like that?

10:41.897 --> 10:45.109
Well, a flying boar
is the symbol of the Beifong family.

10:45.192 --> 10:46.902
They're the richest people in town,

10:46.986 --> 10:48.863
Probably the whole world.

10:48.946 --> 10:50.739
Yeah, but they don't have a daughter.

10:50.823 --> 10:53.450
A flying boar is good enough for me.
Let's check it out.

10:53.868 --> 10:55.578
Yeah. You better leave.

10:55.828 --> 10:58.330
Hey. I got my eye on you.

10:59.165 --> 11:00.541
Water tribe.

11:01.959 --> 11:03.085
I'm telling you,

11:03.169 --> 11:05.296
the Boulder was standing right there.

11:05.379 --> 11:08.716
I saw the kid strike,
but there was no earthbending.

11:08.799 --> 11:10.467
Nothing made contact.

11:10.551 --> 11:12.803
The Blind Bandit
just fell out of the ring.

11:13.137 --> 11:14.513
She must have took a dive

11:14.597 --> 11:16.432
and split the money with the kid.

11:20.186 --> 11:21.437
( YELLS )

11:21.520 --> 11:23.314
Nobody cheats Xin Fu.

11:30.070 --> 11:32.823
That's the flying boar
from my vision. Come on.

11:42.833 --> 11:44.376
( KIDS SCREAMING )

11:48.255 --> 11:50.466
What are you doing here,
twinkle toes?

11:50.883 --> 11:52.218
How did you know it was me?

11:52.301 --> 11:55.095
Don't answer to twinkle toes.
It's not manly.

11:55.179 --> 11:57.264
You're the one whose bag
matches his belt.

11:57.932 --> 11:59.141
How did you find me?

11:59.225 --> 12:01.143
Well, a crazy king told me I had to find

12:01.227 --> 12:03.187
the earthbender who listens to the earth.

12:03.270 --> 12:05.564
And then I had a vision
in a magic swamp, and―

12:05.648 --> 12:07.316
What Aang is trying to say

12:07.399 --> 12:10.653
is he's the Avatar, and if he doesn't
master earthbending soon,

12:10.736 --> 12:12.655
he won't be able
to defeat the Fire Lord.

12:13.030 --> 12:16.200
Not my problem.
Now get out of here

12:16.283 --> 12:17.701
or I'll call the guards.

12:17.910 --> 12:20.204
Look, we all have to do our part
to win this war.

12:20.287 --> 12:22.957
And yours is to teach
Aang earthbending.

12:23.457 --> 12:25.668
Guards! Guards, help!

12:28.921 --> 12:30.297
Toph, what happened?

12:30.631 --> 12:34.301
I thought I heard someone. I got scared.

12:34.677 --> 12:37.471
You know your father doesn't want you
wandering the grounds

12:37.554 --> 12:39.139
without supervision, Toph.

12:44.979 --> 12:46.355
( SNIFFS )

12:47.523 --> 12:48.565
I'm pleased to hear

12:48.691 --> 12:51.151
that Toph's private lessons
are going well,

12:51.527 --> 12:54.738
but I want to be sure
she's not trying anything too dangerous.

12:55.114 --> 12:56.782
Absolutely not.

12:56.991 --> 12:59.243
I'm keeping her at the beginner's level―

12:59.326 --> 13:02.288
Basic forms and breathing exercises only.

13:02.705 --> 13:03.914
Very good.

13:04.456 --> 13:07.835
Excuse me, sir,
but you have a visitor.

13:08.419 --> 13:09.962
Who thinks they are so important

13:10.045 --> 13:12.047
they can just come
to my home unannounced?

13:12.131 --> 13:14.967
Uh, the Avatar, sir.

13:23.809 --> 13:25.144
( CHOMPING NOISILY )

13:26.854 --> 13:28.772
Blow on it. It's too hot for her.

13:28.856 --> 13:29.857
Allow me.

13:33.027 --> 13:34.194
Oh, my.

13:34.445 --> 13:38.073
Avatar Aang, it's an honor
to have you visit us.

13:38.699 --> 13:42.578
In your opinion, how much longer
do you think the war will last?

13:42.828 --> 13:45.998
I'd like to defeat
the Fire Lord by the end of summer,

13:46.457 --> 13:47.791
but I can't do that

13:47.875 --> 13:50.252
without finding
an earthbending teacher first.

13:50.794 --> 13:54.048
Well, Master Yu
is the finest teacher in the land.

13:54.131 --> 13:56.258
He's been teaching Toph
since she was little.

13:56.633 --> 13:58.635
Then she must be a great earthbender,

13:59.553 --> 14:02.014
Probably good enough to teach
someone else. Ow!

14:05.768 --> 14:07.728
Toph is still
learning the basics.

14:08.395 --> 14:11.148
Yes. And, sadly,
because of her blindness,

14:11.231 --> 14:13.525
I don't think she will ever
become a true master.

14:15.027 --> 14:17.988
Oh, I'm sure she's better
than you think she is.

14:18.072 --> 14:19.073
Uh!

14:29.666 --> 14:32.127
( SNEEZES )

14:34.630 --> 14:36.215
What's your problem?

14:36.298 --> 14:37.800
What's your problem?

14:40.636 --> 14:43.639
Well, shall we move to the living room

14:43.722 --> 14:45.099
for dessert, then?

14:48.560 --> 14:49.645
Good night, buddy.

14:52.231 --> 14:53.315
Hyah!

14:53.607 --> 14:56.527
Relax. Look, I'm sorry about dinner.

14:56.777 --> 14:58.404
Let's call it a truce, ok?

15:01.156 --> 15:04.827
Even though I was born blind,
I've never had a problem seeing.

15:06.495 --> 15:07.955
I see with earthbending.

15:08.497 --> 15:10.707
It's kind of like
seeing with my feet.

15:11.166 --> 15:13.252
I feel the vibrations
in the earth,

15:13.544 --> 15:15.754
and I can see where everything is―

15:16.255 --> 15:20.717
You, that tree, even those ants.

15:23.762 --> 15:25.097
That's amazing.

15:25.180 --> 15:27.057
My parents don't understand.

15:28.183 --> 15:30.519
They've always treated me
like I was helpless.

15:30.978 --> 15:33.230
Is that why you became
the Blind Bandit?

15:33.313 --> 15:34.314
Yeah.

15:34.940 --> 15:37.109
Then why stay here
where you're not happy?

15:37.192 --> 15:38.902
They're my parents.

15:38.986 --> 15:40.696
Where else am I supposed to go?

15:42.114 --> 15:43.365
You could come with us.

15:43.449 --> 15:46.493
Yeah. You guys get to go
wherever you want.

15:46.577 --> 15:50.164
No one telling you
what to do― That's the life.

15:50.956 --> 15:52.416
It's just not my life.

15:55.878 --> 15:57.087
We're being ambushed.

16:14.688 --> 16:17.983
I think you kids
owe me some money.

16:24.281 --> 16:26.617
Whoever took Aang
and Toph left this.

16:27.493 --> 16:29.369
"If you want to see
your daughter again,

16:29.453 --> 16:31.580
bring 500 gold pieces
to the arena."

16:31.663 --> 16:34.208
It's signed "Xin Fu
and the Boulder."

16:34.291 --> 16:35.626
I can't believe it.

16:36.126 --> 16:38.337
I have the Boulder's autograph!

16:40.130 --> 16:43.175
Master Yu, I need you
to help me get my daughter back.

16:43.258 --> 16:44.593
We're going with you.

16:45.928 --> 16:47.137
Poor Toph!

16:47.471 --> 16:48.847
She must be so scared.

16:49.389 --> 16:51.892
You think you're so tough,
why don't you come up here

16:51.975 --> 16:53.977
so I can smack that
grin off your face?

16:54.061 --> 16:55.312
I'm not smiling.

16:55.979 --> 16:57.439
SOKKA: Toph!

16:58.106 --> 17:00.192
Here's your money.
Now, let them go.

17:11.119 --> 17:12.579
What about Aang?

17:12.663 --> 17:16.542
I think the Fire Nation
will pay a hefty price for the Avatar.

17:16.917 --> 17:19.336
Now get out of my ring.

17:35.978 --> 17:37.604
Go. I'll be ok.

17:40.983 --> 17:44.319
Toph, there's too many of them.
We need an earthbender.

17:44.403 --> 17:45.904
We need you.

17:45.988 --> 17:47.864
My daughter
is blind.

17:47.948 --> 17:51.493
She is blind and tiny and helpless
and fragile.

17:51.618 --> 17:53.078
She cannot help you.

17:53.579 --> 17:55.205
Yes, I can.

18:02.379 --> 18:03.714
Let him go.

18:04.214 --> 18:06.592
I beat you all before,
and I'll do it again.

18:07.009 --> 18:09.970
The Boulder takes
issue with that comment.

18:12.889 --> 18:14.016
Wait.

18:19.938 --> 18:21.106
They're mine.

19:07.069 --> 19:08.153
Ugh.

19:09.863 --> 19:10.864
Hit it harder!

19:10.947 --> 19:11.948
I'm trying.

19:45.524 --> 19:47.025
Aah!

19:47.150 --> 19:49.319
( GROWLING )

19:50.737 --> 19:53.448
( GROWLING )

19:56.493 --> 19:58.578
( EARTHBENDER YELLS )

20:13.719 --> 20:16.805
I never knew.
Your daughter's amazing.

20:22.227 --> 20:23.812
( NECK CRACKING )

21:08.857 --> 21:13.111
She's the greatest
earthbender I've ever seen.

21:14.738 --> 21:16.907
Dad, I know it's probably hard

21:17.032 --> 21:18.450
for you to see me this way,

21:18.533 --> 21:20.702
but the obedient little
helpless blind girl

21:20.827 --> 21:22.871
that you think I am
just isn't me.

21:23.455 --> 21:24.790
I love fighting.

21:25.373 --> 21:26.917
I love being an earthbender.

21:27.626 --> 21:29.920
And I'm really, really good at it.

21:30.796 --> 21:32.923
I know I've kept my life secret from you,

21:33.006 --> 21:35.884
but you were keeping me secret
from the whole world.

21:35.967 --> 21:37.552
You were doing it to protect me.

21:38.053 --> 21:40.847
But I'm 12 years old,
and I've never had a real friend.

21:42.974 --> 21:44.768
So now that you see
who I really am,

21:44.851 --> 21:47.312
I hope it doesn't change
the way you feel about me.

21:47.395 --> 21:50.524
Of course it doesn't change
the way I feel about you, Toph.

21:51.066 --> 21:52.651
It's made me realize something.

21:53.318 --> 21:54.361
It has?

21:54.653 --> 21:58.323
Yes. I've let you have
far too much freedom.

21:58.448 --> 22:00.867
From now on,
you will be cared for and guarded

22:00.951 --> 22:02.327
24 hours a day.

22:02.410 --> 22:03.537
But, Dad―

22:03.620 --> 22:06.456
MRS. BEIFONG: We are doing this
for your own good, Toph.

22:06.540 --> 22:09.292
MR. BEIFONG: Please escort
the Avatar and his friends out.

22:09.793 --> 22:12.003
They are no longer
welcome here.

22:12.504 --> 22:14.089
I'm sorry, Toph.

22:14.172 --> 22:17.425
I'm sorry, too.
Good-bye, Aang.

22:22.556 --> 22:24.641
Don't worry. We'll find you a teacher.

22:25.267 --> 22:28.103
There are plenty of amazing
earthbenders out there.

22:28.228 --> 22:29.646
Not like her.

22:36.069 --> 22:37.445
( DISTANT PANTING )

22:39.573 --> 22:41.408
Toph, what are you doing here?

22:41.741 --> 22:43.410
My dad changed his mind.

22:43.493 --> 22:46.121
He said I was free to travel the world.

22:47.289 --> 22:49.416
Well, we'd better get out of here

22:49.499 --> 22:51.459
before your dad changes his mind again.

22:51.918 --> 22:53.336
Good idea.

22:53.420 --> 22:55.463
You're gonna be a great teacher, Toph.

22:55.922 --> 22:58.758
Speaking of which,
I want to show you something.

22:58.884 --> 22:59.885
Ok.

23:00.343 --> 23:01.511
Aah!

23:02.053 --> 23:03.346
Now we're even.

23:03.930 --> 23:05.265
Um, I'll take the belt back.

23:08.643 --> 23:09.644
Ow!

23:10.103 --> 23:11.313
SOKKA: Sorry.

23:13.607 --> 23:15.817
MR. BEIFONG: I know you two
are very different,

23:15.901 --> 23:18.737
but I believe you have
a common interest.

23:23.116 --> 23:25.327
The Avatar has kidnapped my daughter.

23:25.785 --> 23:30.290
I want you to do whatever it takes
to bring her home.
